infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Where a bad config blows up: boot vs first request
  desc A validationSchema runs once at module init; with no schema the missing var stays undefined until a code path touches it
  compares
    - label Validate at boot (fail fast)
      children
        - label Throws during bootstrap
          desc Precise message at module init, process never starts
        - label Engineer sees it in the deploy log
          desc Seconds after deploy, not on a customer
        - label New pods never go healthy
          desc The rollout halts before serving traffic
        - label Reports every bad var at once
          desc validationOptions abortEarly false
    - label No validation (fail lazily)
      children
        - label Stays undefined until first use
          desc Only the one code path that reads it triggers
        - label Surfaces hours after deploy
          desc Far from the deploy that caused it
        - label Crashes on a real customer
          desc First checkout hits new Stripe(undefined)
        - label Invisible the whole time
          desc Nothing checked, so nothing crashed at boot
theme
  palette #14b8a6 #f43f5e
